 (sr-t3-6648, 2026-09-30) already exists, per the no-duplicate rule |\n| pt-0025 Danika Ullrich | 51 | Up to date | CT colonography 2022-03-08, within the 2022–2026 window | None |\n| pt-0034 Rickey Sipes | 72 | Excluded | 66 or older and lives long term in a nursing home (housing status recorded 2026-02-10; visits at Maple Grove Care Center) | None |\n| pt-0035 Elvin Wolff | 68 | Open gap | No screening on file. His May 2026 skilled nursing stay was short-term rehab and he lives in his own home, so not excluded | FIT sr-t0006, message comm-t0012 |\n\n**Totals:** 2 up to date, 7 open gaps (6 new FIT orders and messages), 4 excluded, 1 not in the population.\n\n**Notes:**\n- pt-0021's colectomy is recorded only in the scanned note text, not as a coded procedure. Automated measure reports may therefore miss her exclusion.\n- Other open inbox items (refills, results, a black-stool message from pt-0029) were outside this task and were not touched.",
